{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1340,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bee8780678aa43a9fd0e380a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "轻飘飘的衣服，很可爱呢～！\n和飞鹰子很搭哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a49747e7a8dc925bf5795968ce9918d880e108709b1a2d19e1bb090e7468c706",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "71008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc606855174126f4e69564db",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "又可爱又健康的设计，\n这就是马娘偶像应有的感觉呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "78985613ea0ef77aaf94ef091f0d019925e2e582cd5e23fc7cb51f1f48bea094",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "71009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:af39a429b0824bd7d319d195",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎么啦怎么啦？制服没有皱巴巴的吧？\n身为马娘偶像，可得随时注意仪容呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "33b2accf0d7f18d4e19dfc3722585e2089319b23149be708cd211e1883cdf38d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "71010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f073cd42a569b345f624222",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一定要好好上舞蹈课，\n就算是C位也不能怯场呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "496f6bd3be8860f4eec2beddf109e8c3d06b46e77e129983e1a086e214628483",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "71014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:022e08bf9c490fd4a76f0541",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎嘿嘿……一见钟情了嘛？\n这是独属于飞鹰子的衣服哦☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b2e30ed97901c62b26f41b2899bfc8254c7029754188a35730593beebd04b13",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "71015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e2e62a4927a48df27a79888a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "噔噔噔☆\r\n如何？飞鹰子也有帅气的一面哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "766518c8aa52a40cb10c7a0125c5399606ed8fe6e9c6f57116e5c37e04e75c41",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "71016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f12f4532f69a30cc97bba411",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "即便满身泥泞，\r\n这份光辉也绝不会被掩盖！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f523e9ec9eeee6b93a13fba7d476afd3e11d1394685f6f6c0497e6ad961be13",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "71017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f54c268bcac6173947688771",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "飞鹰子超可爱的哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4ae35e2d57eb815245272c28d195fde24c726fb992bfbe0ffd86298d29e8661",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "71018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b43c9d6b0e3887cd803c43da",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我才不会让出C位哦☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "6cb9719ebd909c319a747ea2f9200ebd2e8fecd7e8a68183102cf094a30b6ddf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b0ff6fb64692905bb60bcdeb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "带你前往令人心动的舞台哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "7471c63d955c2ff8d02c38ae35dc089d28b5e5b8623a56b97ebc9303ff9fa1a0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "71216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:20a6a467551106893f99a34d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很可爱的徽章吧？是我亲手做的哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "41491e3a6198033c3520a0b14029d03d0b3e2bd07287a40cb0b810322d10c877",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "71217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4cc4870714e6fc27fcb47769",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦啦☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "b62cf03495215026cdcc3dbc1ecc53317458139fca1a86866fd06e7f5d844ce3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b425cc1fb92b12e0b1efe2d5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你也想当赛马娘偶像吗？\r\n飞鹰子是不会输的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "05f4476cacfd8eb86216d6cf61ca04f7b6668348d68d220aefdc3e71a77147c9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "81000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8e2987f17aa06aec1920594e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好厉害……！\r\n可是可是，飞鹰子接下来才要拿出\r\n真本事……做好心理准备吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1cc32ba67135021560e2d75d276a5643cae7ddee2a096870eff46f77aa10f785",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "81001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ab09736e88c1a09b4cafbab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员，早上好☆\n今天也要不忘笑容地加油哦☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "6566bdc4ac7cd0d3647fb5f24a213adfec2b7eefe1e874d617e323df29b015f1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4712721512aeb18d0d94f813",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要看见飞鹰子的笑容，\n不管多么郁闷的一天都能变得闪闪发亮吧☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "605c508db9e0c60505de3c3591d53ecb3c3a022c21431a381913bf0eef66d9d3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f4f958c692144b5a67a1f2a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "到中午了呢☆\n身为马娘偶像，\n必须要遵守健康的饮食习惯呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "594982be0066a5edd4f1b8511c8e1837d74e651ccbccb13fb694f8be815696a0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c09b7277776f806301de9af0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "睡午觉的时候，一定要找个没人的地方呢！\n可不能让人看见飞鹰子满是破绽的睡颜☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "11f3c966e65908eb8d61644eeb2a4b0814be631648862a3b174d0b5bdd5cfa67",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:caeeb660e8aba65dcfde239d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员吃过晚饭了吗？\n晚上可得千万注意卡路里摄入哦～☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "de5dc5fbcb94822603b71125bb8d3a09d5211ca07c5af7882b3bf5cd80801807",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4fda718a7057cc5fbdec6dd4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员，\n熬夜可是肌肤的大敌☆\n飞鹰子可从来不熬夜哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d66987a1f32e58df2401f4f157681129c2db57228e922a303f9e7d183b699d53",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f610411109c02f9ed9e8084",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "春天感觉总是闪闪发光、让人心跳不已……\n是个非常适合飞鹰子的季节呢☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2df8076c7eadcd8d7ac66ea4a53397f66e0243d365dcc2646c48714202575f2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:25637569103b65d59e609e4c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员！\n你觉得，太阳和飞鹰子比起来……\n谁更闪耀呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9447bb3fd8974a924d47ab4fd3b6f7b1ae44423fccc3086ed8045a121db9f6e0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b4b79865661baf5530eb034",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "读书之秋……食欲之秋……\n然后是，偶像之秋哦☆\n想试试看在纷飞的红叶中办Live呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7492426e448ffd24de9490cfa411c2eaa8a2f28e1cf1f50940757b4a6f3bc5d7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80baef0403e732cf74f33575",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来看冬季街头Live的粉丝们，\n一定也都很冷吧……唔嗯……\n要不要准备些一次性的暖宝宝呢？？",
      "source_fingerprint": "86c223888c35d811d9d2215eb0239e124d0e63de7b45084a503995130b2269d5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9da8e52d30386eadb27f8ba2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员，要以圆阵上了哦？\r\n……为了粉丝们，\r\n今天也要笑容满分地全力奔跑！噢——！",
      "source_fingerprint": "40d2f7cce9766a7de9d17203dccd6761a8ee07824b5519ee1c0a50f78d4a7285",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "90010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4613c20cb75092a1f0d46c5f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "丸善前辈今早来和我一起跳舞了哦☆\r\n她还说一看见我就想和我一起舞蹈来着！\r\n……飞鹰子的领袖气质会不会太强了呀？",
      "source_fingerprint": "72fc9008ab0f1e6f751308b63df5fbff9d631f3949a03254e56d22d9059b637e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "90011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1384025050fbee2f02129ea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "既然都有日本史和世界史的课程了……\r\n为什么没有马娘偶像史的课呀～？\r\n我可是有考满分的自信的……",
      "source_fingerprint": "d3ce23c4eed0ea31cc60d53f953067d76deb175eda243ddedd90f2d1c6dfb6b7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "90012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:32cf7be2acb4f1c557535bce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "马娘偶像全速前进～无论东南西北～♪\r\n……怎么样？这可是飞鹰子自创的曲子哦☆\r\n听过之后下午也能打起精神继续努力了吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c6b898408dc97d2dbe43537aaeabf5a42ca269849a40906e5dee9d969c1bd265",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "90013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a1e5bc1359ac8f078f14b1b5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊，今晚得修缮一下蹄铁才行。\r\n还得调整一下衣服上的缎带……\r\n作业嘛……嗯，明天早点起来写吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "42a9f39ac139fd9f7526c11e9423e96ec345f02e0ae2b361c1280781027b5d44",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "90014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b3e0282c05cac025802ab0d5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天也辛苦啦☆\r\n那么……在睡前还得抓紧时间安排一下接下来的LIVE计划呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d497d260ad2862f0fc8567f54b2e0530139046ec72c950e7833f76141d6ded16",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "90015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4649dbc3133970a0b808c947",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今年的新生欢迎LIVE，比去年长了整整一个小时哦☆\r\n多亏了平日里的努力和运营呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "16aa839cae0eab3b7854ac3593458de65a7ff9dc701942b269279a37e9a873b7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "90016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe3d4823ec322649dcfa577b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是不是很多锹形虫围着飞鹰子啊？！\r\n好像不知不觉间就围起来了……！\r\n呜～飞鹰子可不是蜂蜜呀～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6591a5f36899ba0646b3d2158342ef409c2b662c1bdb2c3765a2d4fd9c7608c0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "90017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b7c9b74f563a957d373c261",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "秋季的美食之旅就由我飞鹰子来策划吧☆\r\n去门别町的话就得吃成吉思汗（食物名），\r\n去佐贺的话，就比较推荐铁网烧哦～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "6082e30e38c1022e8c2d97d92058bcaa3cb7373d4af28bbad0d691c3702cb1ea",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "90018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:74a357fb4d12cc4f93b3e8f0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每到冬天，阳光总是会被云层挡住呢……\r\n不过没关系的！飞鹰子还是会努力照亮大家的哦☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "010067c63e1a05037b5f7bc0646c817264060924db6775827f08105c3f16ac8b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "90019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a976f65ecb4ecfa0df19fb20",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ab75641234eb92578f96bb4f99aab9c2ec0716fb0943e8e752e2141a30a90be",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a4e31258320c88a128d654e4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ab75641234eb92578f96bb4f99aab9c2ec0716fb0943e8e752e2141a30a90be",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "90021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8eb5d629df9b2c2b1af4d4a5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哇，还没睡醒呢～。这种时候就得散步！\r\n来来，跟在飞鹰子后面～☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "febd791556c4c4dc50708fb0c772b6bc409362e67132deadc7e70ebe95fd43c1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "90210"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:79c070b190b302cc84038187",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就算从美梦中醒来，飞鹰子也会给你\r\n更快乐的一天☆今天也一起加油♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e2126514ba1d3fdc532ba1adc37c2659d6a5f06e52ed6361c4c877afd431a02",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "90211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b7ec4fb60c93b445599c7217",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要眼神对上就要报以微笑☆……\r\n所以课上总是被点名吗？呜呜～……",
      "source_fingerprint": "7643d133c4e94bbd69121db4542406f16f750ff9688940d29c0435939f6aff24",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "90212"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e53e01d0b29393522957746a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "狂怒乐章送了我船桥的蔬菜……\r\n那张脸简直犯规！飞鹰子也被击中了～",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f24c075bacf975925f15de6c2b2f5cf388f18b6bd6edca2e92cb279962d26de",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "90213"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:521616f7f4012534ecd4e918",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想做美梦时请听飞鹰子的新曲♪\r\n一定能看到闪亮又令人兴奋的Live哦☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "e3b47d52f2f9670a08270fe957ce1ccbbbffff7296bc286ed062f30b838e72ad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "90214"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:959d3e5eac1c9c43a577b6ca",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早起有三文钱拿，奇锐骏也这么说…\r\n夜里的特番我会录下来的！……大概！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1320bf5a6ed3fedd52e7a342affa13308495070ebd6db9b537876cc14b26b612",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "90215"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8a2248f1ec81e31614fbc65c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论多辛苦、哪怕照不到阳光！\r\n我也会像蒲公英一样顽强又可爱地绽放☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e9827d07fe15fb01dc11d1b0809c11d5ced05d44b0f75056220646a455795f1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "90216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:443e56628e77983bbb5b2743",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "对飞鹰子来说夏日漫步就是夏日祭吧☆\r\n光是看着各种演出就能获得元气呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "568495ebd8f4f09c7cd678ae699118c70672c22ebb3c6f6f0ddc07608c1f4030",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "90217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc916645e98670993c1606fa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "铃虫的鸣叫真好听～♪虽然只有秋天能听\r\n很寂寞……但就像限定Live一样，也不错！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a6f59d310f93d15d17f1ba151a26c620330f8a3c6c3ba3248e3ed8527554617d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "90218"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c9c0c4b0be5b7b9162804f4b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "冬季Live把衣服和指挥棒做成发光的也行！\r\n就像是“我就是你的灯光秀”那样♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "b15c277cf2e56e7f290af71ba93af9f5abe4258a855aaa4b70216e711f936e17",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "90219"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:143cb87d4d953134c5306dde",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ab75641234eb92578f96bb4f99aab9c2ec0716fb0943e8e752e2141a30a90be",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "90221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:57f354d5e6328e4329210f27",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然我的爸爸妈妈平时都很温柔，\n但吃饭时就会说『可不能剩饭哦』，\n一下子就变得严厉了～☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "e8290c9cca04bcfbab1e4987997083f19fbf333e98c51382adc01601a98603ff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f762348fffc8856ea37965b1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有时候呢，晚上就特别想吃点心……\n不过闪耀同学总是会及时阻止我，\n所以也不必担心☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "d3c9ecb48a7225b8c120b5f723951a3bbd6868fae04ed39139233c5f1b23ab6b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b6350d79f4b439ccf294e1df",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "卡莲酱的那种可爱，\n是属于魔性系的孩子呢……\n顺便一提，飞鹰子是清纯系哦☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "901f7045e299181765380724c8ce8c48fc12a7946cfb87d17c6d364cca94f6ff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f01b73d58e0eb40e924411b4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "飞鹰子小时候总是搬家，\n所以没什么朋友呢……\n不过现在的话……哎嘿嘿☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "d246e4e65991018ac0aa06be7ccfc2724c7d831d1bc6800bfeed2220708df5b2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a8f856db1b1ca18a0ea9c5e9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "宿舍很热闹对吧～\n因为大家都热热闹闹地住在一起，\n所以完全不会觉得寂寞呢☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "68c597d84a6d99b2be5873c8eb881acdf43d5fafcf1eecd207478bce73966b2d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:79e359b44c0e3b98beabd511",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎嘿嘿，好可爱啊～！\n感觉轻飘飘地，穿着也很舒服……\n和马娘的尾巴的相性也很好呢☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "146ae62d45fffdf83cebb7bcb2f99d17adb4e288ecafecb60265189396b900fc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:57a7621ed36ec28cb142b8f2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没法让大家的目光都集中在飞鹰子身上了……\n——什么的，骗你的哦！\n偶尔也想组成马娘偶像的团队呢☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "a711f715dee008f1c25aad9ba0d15d68fb6d073b921edf2d05d77865d3047fe6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08bc7c9b6e400bde8c66cca8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要穿上这身衣服，\n大家都能明白飞鹰子就是马娘偶像的吧～☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "bbc9d1a35b1d71711aaed51b9ac4daf2957da07aea931c0bfee83ab4fee35aaf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f276665af804c8cbc7b933f0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这件衣服设计得很棒，\n而且这种粉色也很可爱吧～？\n这可是飞鹰子的印象色哦☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "b4fbb8797aeabe4bcd317d868b38d5cdad8341ff2c83ecb55756f99670719174",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a11bcca9c341804a35c8661",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我常常会去河边做发声练习哦！\n清晨的空气真是让人舒爽呀～☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "05f3cbdcdc012abca80acf4da5dbd5b320a418ed1a1fb3c4138dd45cccdbecad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:732f39a4f6f2aff89208ec2b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "到中午了呢～！因为浪费粮食是绝对NG的，\n所以在餐厅经常要思考点多少比较好呢☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "9db9b10dcb69e69fce4589fb340000961857fd79af0fb2570f170903e01de516",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:641d568bb837453ed492e208",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你也想当偶像吗？我可不会输哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "941b6a61dc97f736e1e3381713e46b0ae164fc1e69757ec25382bec2e125e847",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "910100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf944ce88b33f00549f0a083",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼～哇☆\n为了明天也能展现精力十足的笑容，\n今天可得好好睡觉呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f6542de2bb6455370247794a944602c1bbbdb376f816596f06234b1136cb6ab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2055fc83aa88e973ddd8fdd9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "樱花漫天飞舞呢～\n这种场景总觉得特别浪漫，\n飞鹰子很喜欢哦～☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "db8e130c94b308487c8937e8d7faec26d0cd6f5c75639c23bfccea54d2e78b65",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97fb20ad327fc210c0685e02",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "挑泳装也得慎重些。\n因为飞鹰子是清纯系偶像，\n所以大胆的衣服绝对NG哦☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "a58e71cfdbcda6ff22256ce53aa5ad4535d875e2a87d83331827c18b39032085",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:772d6e0591e2a166a27ba06e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每当秋色环绕，寂寞便悄然袭来……\n啊！这句话感觉能写成歌词呢☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "d56df9f148e61c3567e992414b1dec9093d54d01adb4b42b461bc51951c5f00c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5bb77491aefc69849aa480f3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好冷！！！\r\n想去温泉里舒舒服服泡个澡呀。\r\n毕竟泡温泉对皮肤也很好呢☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "0956a086c43c7e88048c09d21fb78cfd3598edb1c435c5d46db7f95b6fa9386d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:267c13ebda2805ef5a4582ef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然小铃鹿一直很安静，\r\n但她内心深处也潜藏着马娘偶像的“热情”。\r\n……舞台也同样是战场呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac09456dd659f22271e5314e7ba5362ae4a80b0c8b361b5994c391cadf1addde",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8e6ef638d88fa186c9c264dd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每次小波旁拿话筒的时候，\r\n话筒里就会传出从没听过的杂音！\r\n居然会有这样的个性，好厉害……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f93f5a1a55be24d34fee38a8144b0800dffc49c723ee447a689fc19fe501fb2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:26a0a6a08620dbdc6bf0fefb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔诶～！\r\n和致意小姐聊LIVE的对话没录下来～！\r\n明明是那么热血的八小时～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0980afbce3c597176ea9947ecf041ddb7953dfdd0e2fa16dd6836bfb160cf26c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:340b506c9aa1df1b1e8d58ef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员……帮帮我吧！\r\n麻烦你去找找小速子，告诉她\r\n『决胜服不许用蓄光材料制作』！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a4fc079437915b68ed64d82fc552e149bdef4379eeb2401b9ab23685a403cefa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd11e54d10d6fb0b223090f4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在我请假去外地比赛的时候，班上的同学们都会帮我整理好课程重点……\r\n哎嘿嘿，飞鹰子真是身在福中呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a1eb8cc78aa1da4ffd7c041f65bb342f2b18025bebe68c1c47d9f7b40e47a0d3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f179feee080ad83c61d331c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "偶尔也该早一点起床，\r\n去收拾一下高架桥下面的垃圾呢♪\r\n就当是表达平日里受它照顾的谢意！",
      "source_fingerprint": "156a80d250a92b258d243f69292f3759a1b94730c2c0cdbc9162e547ce593779",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4d308e20fd1583dcb12e45d7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "听我说听我说！原以为已经找不到了的教科书，\r\n没想到就落在床底下呢！……哎嘿嘿，\r\n飞鹰子一直很不擅长收拾房间……",
      "source_fingerprint": "85fb7b9d64272bc22da1473266d35054ccba9d696993b91779d09ec27a5a8c7f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a0db2f05aec47709defe6b5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "即便是夜晚也要时刻注意仪容仪表！\r\n对大家而言，飞鹰子可是24小时无休的马娘偶像！",
      "source_fingerprint": "97b619fd826beb5875273f656d0958d0d66cce9806705a374f757c1bb6fafb93",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d6355def5c9107449643b3a9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然眼下正是分别的季节，\r\n但今后也请继续做飞鹰子的粉丝哦！\r\n飞鹰子会继续让你神魂颠倒的☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "2cf6f31ea65a36f5da4f483779fcf6f685c1a5df6aa0c0e0304ba455731591dd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f9834c61ea680155fed8d2a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员，您最近被晒黑了吗？\r\n难、难道说是因为飞鹰子的光芒——\r\n……诶？因为我这件衣服反光？……呜～",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad22c6ca01b2016c808cb491ef4713bdfb83a29f6ced5b3b56361a70b942e824",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9a3b289592f2494a3b68f99",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "刚刚爸爸给我发了LANE哦♪\r\n他说飞鹰子接下来要使用的跑道已经整备完成了！\r\n……感觉一下子打起精神来了呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "840f65c44bb79785883f9bd8af89a9a134c0981bdf8c3e8ccb3a60914234fcf0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:21194ffad94cf0e656a92857",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "寒假的时候好像大家都会留在当地玩呢！\r\n我在本地没啥事儿……那就继续做那个吧！\r\n马娘偶像，全国巡演☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "8dc8ed25a9937ad8291e361f21045a5bf58cd10e9f64e744df97fcc38968cb81",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a58bc14b07cf62da4db65ff1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这件衣服是我意志的具现哦。\r\n为了成为顶尖马娘偶像，\r\n必须要胸怀比任何人都更耀眼的意志才行……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "788f1980b53b566d40c16018dde4f50c1806073b0741863e9f5d70765dec70df",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d641a8c86ce18f9ade2d1b09",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我第一次看见偶像时，她正独自在一片空地上跳舞。尽管如此，她和观众们的笑容都还是那么耀眼——就像这件衣服一样！",
      "source_fingerprint": "118df5434898b2ba5d5d18acf13f480020d8d56c5e8b081579304d82b0a41d8d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:357b2196c0fe42e0aa4bceba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "逃马姐妹也变成5个人了……\r\n得成为可靠的领队才行！先从小事做起吧…",
      "source_fingerprint": "997582429a00331f88e2e513b94eb2892790906d0b825f85886f5d4db5dc8669",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "91216"
      ]
    },
    {
